<mujoco model="dreamer">
  <!--
    Top Kart Dreamer (MSTEM3 E1) for the AKS kart.

    Frame: chassis origin = rear axle centre, x forward, y left, z up (metres).

    Sources
      CAD (team Fusion STEP exports): frame (kart_frame_solid), rims, rear tyre,
        rear hubs, sprocket hub, 200 mm brake rotor, caliper, lower engine mount.
        Meshes are in assets/, already in this frame or centred on their own axis.
      Top Kart spec: 1040 mm wheelbase, 30 mm frame tube, 50 mm rear axle,
        kingpin inclination 10.2 deg, 25 mm spindles.
      BoM: Motenergy ME1716 motor (~10 kg), 240 x Samsung 25R 18650 pack
        (16S15P, ~15 kg built), Hoosier R60B 4.5 / 7.10 on 5" rims.
      AKS rule minimum 125 kg, reached with ballast.

    Placeholders (MEASURE on the chassis, then edit here)
      - caster angle (12 deg assumed) and spindle length (kingpin -> wheel centre 0.194 m)
      - track widths: 1.00 m front, 1.15 m rear (tyre centre to tyre centre)
      - frame tube centre height above ground: 0.05 m
      - motor / battery / electronics / ballast positions, gear ratio (~5.5:1)
      - frame torsional flex: not modelled (rigid chassis)

    Mass budget (kg): frame 11 (CAD tubes, 30/26 mm hollowed), motor 10, battery 15,
    electronics 5, steering column + motor 3.5, brake actuator 1.5, engine mount 0.8,
    caliper 0.5, floor pan 2, nose 3, side pods 4, rear bumper 1 (no seat: autonomous),
    ballast 50.7 (low on the frame) -> chassis body 108.0;
    rear axle body 12.05 (axle, rims, tyres, hubs, rotor, sprocket);
    knuckles 2 x 0.8; front wheels 2 x 1.69.
    Whole kart: 125.0 kg, 40 % on the front axle, centre of mass 0.107 m above the ground,
    yaw inertia ~21.8 kg m^2.

    Collisions: kart parts (contype 2, conaffinity 1) touch the world (floor: 1/1) but
    not each other. Frame = capsules along the CAD tube centre lines (bends split into
    <= 30 deg segments); hubs, rotor, sprocket hub, caliper, engine mount = their CAD
    mesh (convex hull); tyres = cylinders. Collision geoms are in group 3 (hidden; press
    3 in the viewer to show them).
  -->
  <compiler angle="radian" meshdir="assets" inertiafromgeom="false"/>
  <option timestep="0.002" gravity="0 0 -9.81" integrator="implicitfast"/>
  <statistic center="0.5 0 0.1" extent="2.0"/>
  <visual>
    <headlight diffuse="0.7 0.7 0.7" ambient="0.3 0.3 0.3"/>
    <rgba haze="0.15 0.2 0.3 1"/>
  </visual>
